from the depths will come up and bless the sword, and it will be called
Excalibur automatically.  One problem, though.......In previous versions,
it was automatically a +5 Excalibur.  Now, that is no longer the case.
It is Excalibur, but has the same + or - quality it had before the murky
hand came up to bless it.....................Linda Jackson


